{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"probability-lesson06","version":1,"title":"確率論基礎","subtitle":"第6回 · 添付画像・正規分布","scope":"ユーザー指定の第6回。添付画像1の§5.6だけ。正規分布の密度、標準化、平均と分散。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"apps/recall-quiz/sources/probability/normal.png","sha256":"450dcfb3147e401d967a4c18193255d28c6147829af60603c83634a21faee2bc","pageCount":1,"reviewedPages":[1],"method":"原資料の該当ページ画像を目視し、問題・解答・適用条件を照らし合わせた。添付画像は画像1枚を1ページとして参照する。"}],"questions":[{"id":"probability-l06-q01","version":1,"prompt":"平均μ、分散σ²>0の正規分布N(μ,σ²)の確率密度関数は？","answer":"\\(f(x)=\\dfrac1{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma^2}}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\dfrac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right)\\)、\\(x\\in\\mathbb R\\)。","criterion":"正規化係数と、指数の分母2σ²・負号が正しければ正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"normal.png","page":1,"imageKey":"450dcfb3147e401d967a4c18193255d28c6147829af60603c83634a21faee2bc:1"}],"promptHtml":"平均μ、分散σ²&gt;0の正規分布N(μ,σ²)の確率密度関数は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)=\\dfrac1{\\sqrt{2\\pi\\sigma^2}}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\dfrac{(x-\\mu)^2}{2\\sigma^2}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x\\in\\mathbb R</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"正規化係数と、指数の分母2σ²・負号が正しければ正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"probability-l06-q02","version":1,"prompt":"\\(X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)\\)、σ>0とする。標準正規分布N(0,1)に従う変数ZをXからどう作る？","answer":"\\(Z=(X-\\mu)/\\sigma\\)。","criterion":"平均を引き、分散ではなく標準偏差σで割れば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"normal.png","page":1,"imageKey":"450dcfb3147e401d967a4c18193255d28c6147829af60603c83634a21faee2bc:1"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>、σ&gt;0とする。標準正規分布N(0,1)に従う変数ZをXからどう作る？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z=(X-\\mu)/\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"平均を引き、分散ではなく標準偏差σで割れば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"probability-l06-q03","version":1,"prompt":"\\(X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)\\)のとき、E[X]とV(X)は？","answer":"\\(E[X]=\\mu\\)、\\(V(X)=\\sigma^2\\)。","criterion":"第2パラメータが標準偏差ではなく分散と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"normal.png","page":1,"imageKey":"450dcfb3147e401d967a4c18193255d28c6147829af60603c83634a21faee2bc:1"}],"promptHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span>のとき、E[X]とV(X)は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[X]=\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V(X)=\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"第2パラメータが標準偏差ではなく分散と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""}],"sourceImages":{"450dcfb3147e401d967a4c18193255d28c6147829af60603c83634a21faee2bc:1":"./assets/sources/450dcfb3147e401d967a4c18193255d28c6147829af60603c83634a21faee2bc-1.png"},"renderVersion":1}